<title>USA: Cal Fed shareholders approve merger.</title>
<headline>Cal Fed shareholders approve merger.</headline>
<dateline>LOS ANGELES 1996-12-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shareholders of Cal Fed Bancorp Inc said shareholders approved the merger with with First Nationwide Holdings Inc, the parent of First Nationwide Bank.</p>
<p>It said the transaction is expected to close in the first quarter of 1997.</p>
</text>
